// rts/data/units/skai/roc_rider.json: Roc Rider, heavy flyer that hits air and ground. Part of rts/data/units; read by the data loader (rts/src/Sim/Data) into a UnitDefinition at match start. Every number is a placeholder for playtesting, not a balance decision.
{
  "$schema_version": 1,
  "$doc": "Roc Rider unit definition for the skai faction (heavy flyer that hits air and ground); placeholder numbers until the Phase 1 unit docs are written.",
  // Stable unit ID, equal to the faction folder, a dot and the file name. Unit: text ID. Range: lower-case letters, digits, underscores and dots. Source: docs/decisions/ADR-003-entity-ids.md.
