  "build_seconds": 30,
  // Armour type, picks the row of the damage table in tuning/combat.json that applies to hits on this unit. Unit: armour type name. Range: one of the armour_types in tuning/combat.json ("light", "armoured", "structure"); defaults to default_armour_type when absent. Source: Matchups and balance / Balance philosophy (soft counters only); placeholder.
