  // How far the unit sees while its effective layer is Air, shorter than sight_range_tiles so flyers get no free vision. Required for air units, rejected for others. Unit: tiles. Range: 1 to 64. Source: Maps / Layout rules ("short sight range when airborne"); placeholder 6 for the Roc Rider.
